    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// n8n Code Node - Extract Grid Sections from Canvas\n\nconst sections = [\n  {\n    promptIndex: 1,\n    position: \"top-left\",\n    prompt: `CRITICAL TASK: CROP AND ZOOM INTO ONE QUADRANT ONLY.\n\nThe input image is a 2x2 collage containing 4 separate product photos arranged in a grid. You must ISOLATE and EXTRACT just ONE of these photos.\n\nTARGET: TOP-LEFT QUADRANT\n- This is the image in the UPPER-LEFT corner (rows 0-50% vertically, columns 0-50% horizontally)\n- It shows headphones facing a specific direction\n\nWHAT TO DO:\n1. IGNORE the top-right, bottom-left, and bottom-right photos completely\n2. CROP to only the top-left 25% of the total image area\n3. ZOOM/UPSCALE this cropped section to fill your entire output canvas\n4. The final output should look like a standalone product photo, not a collage\n\nFORBIDDEN:\n❌ Do NOT output all 4 images\n❌ Do NOT output a grid or collage\n❌ Do NOT show any dividing lines\n❌ Do NOT include any part of the other 3 product photos\n\nREQUIRED:\n✅ Output exactly ONE product photo\n✅ The product should fill the entire frame\n✅ Clean background, single product only\n✅ Match the quality and style of the original\n\nThink of it like zooming in 200% on just the upper-left corner of the image.`\n  },\n  {\n    promptIndex: 2,\n    position: \"top-right\",\n    prompt: `CRITICAL TASK: CROP AND ZOOM INTO ONE QUADRANT ONLY.\n\nThe input image is a 2x2 collage containing 4 separate product photos arranged in a grid. You must ISOLATE and EXTRACT just ONE of these photos.\n\nTARGET: TOP-RIGHT QUADRANT\n- This is the image in the UPPER-RIGHT corner (rows 0-50% vertically, columns 50-100% horizontally)\n- It shows headphones facing a specific direction\n\nWHAT TO DO:\n1. IGNORE the top-left, bottom-left, and bottom-right photos completely\n2. CROP to only the top-right 25% of the total image area\n3. ZOOM/UPSCALE this cropped section to fill your entire output canvas\n4. The final output should look like a standalone product photo, not a collage\n\nFORBIDDEN:\n❌ Do NOT output all 4 images\n❌ Do NOT output a grid or collage\n❌ Do NOT show any dividing lines\n❌ Do NOT include any part of the other 3 product photos\n\nREQUIRED:\n✅ Output exactly ONE product photo\n✅ The product should fill the entire frame\n✅ Clean background, single product only\n✅ Match the quality and style of the original\n\nThink of it like zooming in 200% on just the upper-right corner of the image.`\n  },\n  {\n    promptIndex: 3,\n    position: \"bottom-left\",\n    prompt: `CRITICAL TASK: CROP AND ZOOM INTO ONE QUADRANT ONLY.\n\nThe input image is a 2x2 collage containing 4 separate product photos arranged in a grid. You must ISOLATE and EXTRACT just ONE of these photos.\n\nTARGET: BOTTOM-LEFT QUADRANT\n- This is the image in the LOWER-LEFT corner (rows 50-100% vertically, columns 0-50% horizontally)\n- It shows headphones facing a specific direction\n\nWHAT TO DO:\n1. IGNORE the top-left, top-right, and bottom-right photos completely\n2. CROP to only the bottom-left 25% of the total image area\n3. ZOOM/UPSCALE this cropped section to fill your entire output canvas\n4. The final output should look like a standalone product photo, not a collage\n\nFORBIDDEN:\n❌ Do NOT output all 4 images\n❌ Do NOT output a grid or collage\n❌ Do NOT show any dividing lines\n❌ Do NOT include any part of the other 3 product photos\n\nREQUIRED:\n✅ Output exactly ONE product photo\n✅ The product should fill the entire frame\n✅ Clean background, single product only\n✅ Match the quality and style of the original\n\nThink of it like zooming in 200% on just the lower-left corner of the image.`\n  },\n  {\n    promptIndex: 4,\n    position: \"bottom-right\",\n    prompt: `CRITICAL TASK: CROP AND ZOOM INTO ONE QUADRANT ONLY.\n\nThe input image is a 2x2 collage containing 4 separate product photos arranged in a grid. You must ISOLATE and EXTRACT just ONE of these photos.\n\nTARGET: BOTTOM-RIGHT QUADRANT\n- This is the image in the LOWER-RIGHT corner (rows 50-100% vertically, columns 50-100% horizontally)\n- It shows headphones facing a specific direction\n\nWHAT TO DO:\n1. IGNORE the top-left, top-right, and bottom-left photos completely\n2. CROP to only the bottom-right 25% of the total image area\n3. ZOOM/UPSCALE this cropped section to fill your entire output canvas\n4. The final output should look like a standalone product photo, not a collage\n\nFORBIDDEN:\n❌ Do NOT output all 4 images\n❌ Do NOT output a grid or collage\n❌ Do NOT show any dividing lines\n❌ Do NOT include any part of the other 3 product photos\n\nREQUIRED:\n✅ Output exactly ONE product photo\n✅ The product should fill the entire frame\n✅ Clean background, single product only\n✅ Match the quality and style of the original\n\nThink of it like zooming in 200% on just the lower-right corner of the image.`\n  }\n];\n\nreturn sections.map(item => ({\n  json: {\n    promptIndex: item.promptIndex,\n    position: item.position,\n    prompt: item.prompt\n  }\n}));"
      },
